---
/**
 * The dry-run orchestrator has an API (POST /admin/controlled-activation-dry-run/*)
 * but no client on this page yet. This page used to show invented values
 * (REQ-12345, "GTM", "Facebook CAPI · PREVIEW_READY", READY_FOR_DRY_RUN) and
 * buttons whose only effect was an alert claiming the work was done. Nothing was
 * called and nothing happened. It now says what is true: not connected.
 * Building the client is deferred until the first measurement destination goes
 * live (the trigger recorded in the Phase III estate review).
 */
const endpoints = [
  ['POST', '/execution-plans', 'Create an execution plan for an approved activation request'],
  ['POST', '/dry-runs', 'Start a dry run of a plan (nothing is dispatched)'],
  ['POST', '/dry-runs/:id/previews', 'Generate redacted payload previews'],
  ['POST', '/canary-plans/validate', 'Validate a canary plan'],
  ['POST', '/dry-runs/:id/evidence', 'Build the evidence pack'],
  ['POST', '/execution-plans/:id/ready-for-review', 'Mark a plan ready for live review'],
  ['POST', '/dry-runs/:id/cancel', 'Cancel a dry run'],
];
---
<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-8 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-6">
  <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-2xl p-5" role="status">
    <p class="text-sm font-black text-amber-900">Not configured</p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-amber-900">
      This page is not connected to the dry-run service. No plan, dry run, preview or evidence pack is read or created from here,
      and no status is shown because none is read. Live activation stays blocked either way.
    </p>
  </div>

  <section class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
    <h2 class="text-sm font-black text-gray-900">What exists</h2>
    <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-600">
      The orchestration API is deployed under <code class="font-mono text-xs">/admin/controlled-activation-dry-run</code> and needs the
      settings-management permission. It is write-only: there is no endpoint to list plans or runs, so a page cannot show their state yet.
    </p>
    <table class="mt-4 w-full text-left text-sm">
      <thead>
        <tr class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500">
          <th class="py-2 pr-3 font-black">Method</th><th class="py-2 pr-3 font-black">Path</th><th class="py-2 font-black">Does</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100">
        {endpoints.map(([method, path, does]) => (
          <tr><td class="py-2 pr-3 font-mono text-xs">{method}</td><td class="py-2 pr-3 font-mono text-xs">{path}</td><td class="py-2 text-gray-700">{does}</td></tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </section>

  <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">
    A client for this page is deferred until the first measurement destination goes live. Until then the per-activation review
    lives under Measurement → Control tower → Controlled activation.
  </p>
</div>
